OL,3,APentagon stops using Anthropic AI tools
OL,4,Amonths after blacklisting company, BBC
OL,5,Atold
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe US Department of Defence is no
OL,8,Flonger using Anthropic's AI tools, an
OL,9,Fofficial has told the BBC, months after
OL,10,Fit designated the company a supply
OL,11,Fchain risk on national security
OL,12,Fgrounds.
OL,14,FThe Pentagon "has ceased the use of
OL,15,FAnthropic products", the department
OL,16,Fofficial said in a statement.
OL,18,FSecretary of Defence Pete Hegseth
OL,19,Flabelled Anthropic a supply chain risk
OL,20,Fin February, and announced that the
OL,21,FPentagon would stop using it by late
OL,22,FAugust.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
