OL,3,APentagon stops using Anthropic AI tools
OL,4,Amonths after blacklisting company, BBC
OL,5,Atold
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut multiple people familiar with the
OL,8,Fmatter told the BBC that as recently as
OL,9,Flast week Anthopic's Claude model was
OL,10,Fstill used by the department in
OL,11,Fresearch, analysis and intelligence
OL,12,Fgathering as well as in military
OL,13,Foperations against Iran.
